{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08587","headline":"邯郸南亭观妓 · 李白","name":"邯郸南亭观妓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"歌鼓燕赵儿，魏姝弄鸣丝。\n粉色艳日彩，舞袖拂花枝。\n把酒顾美人，请歌邯郸词。\n清筝何缭绕，度曲绿云垂。\n平原君安在，科斗生古池。\n座客三千人，于今知有谁。\n我辈不作乐，但爲後代悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}